            "Carry out a **rapid health assessment** in the first hours: population affected and displaced, number of dead and injured by area, damage to health facilities, status of water sources and sanitation, shelter and food, access and roads, and the immediate gaps - and transmit it to the district in a written situation report, because relief is allocated on the basis of this assessment.",
