            "Recover bodies with dignity; **identify each body** by photograph, personal effects, distinguishing marks, a unique number and DNA sampling where feasible; keep a register; and hand over or bury/cremate individually with the location recorded, because the family needs a death certificate for inheritance, insurance, compensation and remarriage.",
