        "Management is the process of getting things done through and with people - the planning, organising, staffing, directing, coordinating, reporting and budgeting of men, money, material, machines and minutes so that the stated objectives are achieved; planning is thus one function of management, and the two are joined in a repeating planning cycle that runs from situation analysis through implementation to evaluation and back again.",
