            "Paths: A-B-D-F-G-H = 3+10+4+12+4+3 = **36 days**; A-B-E-F-G-H = 3+10+6+12+4+3 = **38 days**; A-C-F-G-H = 3+7+12+4+3 = **29 days**.",
            "The **critical path is A-B-E-F-G-H, 38 days** - the shortest time in which this campaign can be completed. Training (D) has a float of 38 - 36 = **2 days** and the vaccine and cold chain chain (C) has a float of 38 - 29 = **9 days**.",
            "**Managerial reading:** supervision and any additional manpower go to social mobilisation, session conduct and mop-up, not to the vaccine indent, which has nine days of slack; if the campaign must be finished in 34 days, the critical activities alone are crashed - more mobilisation teams, more session sites per day.",
