            "**Step 1 - Define the objective in writing.** SWOT is meaningless in the abstract; it must be anchored to one decision or goal, for example *can Rampur PHC obtain National Quality Assurance Standards certification within twelve months*.",
            "**Step 2 - Assemble the team and the data.** The medical officer, staff nurses and ANM, pharmacist and laboratory technician, block programme manager, accountant, ASHA facilitator, a Jan Arogya Samiti or panchayat member and a user representative, with a neutral facilitator. Bring the HMIS and IHIP output, stock position, staff in position against sanction, the last Kayakalp or internal assessment score, patient feedback and the block map.",
