            "**SO (maxi-maxi, use strengths to seize opportunities):** constitute the quality team from the full staff complement in week 1 and call the District Quality Assurance Unit for a baseline gap assessment in month 1; use the existing Kayakalp score as the starting platform for the NQAS areas of concern that overlap; take the rising delivery figures to the Collector's monthly review to release the quality incentive early. *Owner: medical officer. Indicator: gap assessment report by day 30.*",
