        "**The same matrix filled with the worked example**, at least three concrete entries in each box for Rampur PHC and its NQAS objective - the examiner has asked for an example, so the boxes must contain facts and figures, not adjectives.",
        "**The TOWS strategy matrix beneath it** - a second two-by-two with Strengths and Weaknesses as the rows, Opportunities and Threats as the columns, and SO, WO, ST and WT written in the four cells with one worked strategy in each.",
        "**A one-line flow of the seven steps** across the bottom of the page: define objective - assemble team and data - brainstorm quadrants - verify - prioritise - pair into SO, WO, ST, WT strategies - action plan with owner, date and indicator, and a return arrow to the review.",
