        "India has some of the largest and most successful social marketing programmes in the world, of which the Nirodh condom programme, oral rehydration salts, Pulse Polio, universal salt iodisation and the institutional delivery push under Janani Suraksha Yojana are the standard examples; social media are now a further channel with great reach and equally great risk.",
