            "**Step 4 - Build the alliance and define roles:** convene the partners, agree a shared objective, form a coordination committee or task force with a named convenor (usually the medical officer with the panchayat president), and set out in writing who will do what, with what resources, by when - with memoranda of understanding where useful and a launch event that gives the alliance visible standing.",
