            "**Classification by the nature of the dust:** **fibrogenic** dusts producing collagenous fibrosis - free silica (silicosis), coal (coal workers' pneumoconiosis), asbestos (asbestosis), beryllium, talc, kaolin, hard metal (cobalt); **inert or benign** dusts producing radiographic opacity without fibrosis or functional loss - iron oxide (siderosis), tin (stannosis), barium (baritosis), antimony; **allergenic or organic** dusts producing hypersensitivity rather than fibrosis - cotton (byssinosis), bagasse (bagassosis), mouldy hay (farmer's lung), grain and bird protein.",
