            "**Financial incentives:** Sukanya Samriddhi Yojana (2015), Dhanalakshmi (2008), Balika Samriddhi Yojana; state conditional cash transfers - Apni Beti Apna Dhan (Haryana 1994), Ladli (Delhi, Haryana), Ladli Laxmi (Madhya Pradesh), Bhagyalakshmi (Karnataka), Kanyashree Prakalpa (West Bengal).",
            "**Education and empowerment:** Right to Education Act 2009, Kasturba Gandhi Balika Vidyalaya, incentive schemes for secondary education, school toilets and sanitary napkins, Scheme for Adolescent Girls, skill training and self-help groups, and political reservation.",
            "**Health system:** registration and mapping of every ultrasound machine, online Form F, decoy and sting operations, National Inspection and Monitoring Committee, helplines with rewards for informers, strengthening of the Civil Registration System, sex ratio at birth as a routine HMIS indicator, Janani Suraksha Yojana and Janani Shishu Suraksha Karyakram, and cradle-baby and adoption schemes.",
            "**IEC and community mobilisation:** mass media campaigns, National Girl Child Day (24 January), Guddi-Gudda boards displaying village sex ratios, engagement of panchayats, religious leaders, mothers-in-law and medical associations, and public recognition of districts that improve.",
