            "The 2000 Act was passed to give effect to the **UN Convention on the Rights of the Child** (ratified by India in 1992), the **Beijing Rules** and the **Riyadh Guidelines**, and was itself amended in 2006 and 2011.",
            "Objects: care, protection, treatment, development and **rehabilitation and social reintegration** of children, through a child-friendly system that keeps the child out of the adult criminal justice system.",
